# `dotnet test --results-directory` at the repo root (what CI does) drops .trx
# files here. The per-project ignores only cover backend/ and backend.Tests/.
TestResults/

# docker-compose secret overrides (see .env.example)
.env

# .NET build output, for every project. backend/ and backend.Tests/ carry their
# own copies of these rules, but backend.SqlServerTests/ had none and its whole
# bin/ and obj/ ended up committed - rebuilt on every `dotnet build`, so every
# build showed up as changes to commit.
